###  https://ref.gs1.org/voc/AllergenTypeCode-ABK
voc:AllergenTypeCode-ABK rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                  <https://gs1.org/voc/AllergenTypeCode> ,
                                  <https://gs1.org/voc/TypeCode> ,
                                  voc:AllergenTypeCode ,
