###  https://ref.gs1.org/voc/OrganicClaimAgencyCode-30
voc:OrganicClaimAgencyCode-30 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                       <https://gs1.org/voc/OrganicClaimAgencyCode> ,
                                       <https://gs1.org/voc/TypeCode> ,
                                       voc:OrganicClaimAgencyCode ,
