###  https://ref.gs1.org/voc/OrganizationRoleType-CENTRAL_PAYMENT_SERVICE
voc:OrganizationRoleType-CENTRAL_PAYMENT_SERVICE rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                          <https://gs1.org/voc/OrganizationRoleType> ,
