###  https://ref.gs1.org/voc/OrganizationRoleType-COMPLIANCE_AUTHORITY_OR_AGENCY
voc:OrganizationRoleType-COMPLIANCE_AUTHORITY_OR_AGENCY rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                 <https://gs1.org/voc/OrganizationRoleType> ,
                                                                 <https://gs1.org/voc/TypeCode> ,
