###  https://ref.gs1.org/voc/RegulationTypeCode-PRODUCT_OF_DAILY_USE_DIRECTIVE
voc:RegulationTypeCode-PRODUCT_OF_DAILY_USE_DIRECTIVE rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                               <https://gs1.org/voc/TypeCode> ,
